                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 3: Confirm (Hidden) -->
                    <div id="step-3" class="fade-in hidden">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">배송 및 검수 확인</h2>
                        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 space-y-4">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span class="text-gray-600 font-medium">B/L (선하증권) 업로드</span>
                                <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">✓ 확인됨</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span class="text-gray-600 font-medium">수입항 도착 및 세관 통과</span>
