                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 4: Settlement (Hidden) -->
                    <div id="step-4" class="fade-in hidden">
                        <div class="text-center mb-6">
                            <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-brand-accent text-white rounded-full mb-4">
                                <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                            </div>
                            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-dark">Settlement Complete</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">에스크로가 해제되어 수출업체로 대금이 지급되었습니다.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 text-sm overflow-hidden">
                            <div class="flex justify-between mb-2"><span class="text-gray-500">지급액:</span><span class="font-bold text-brand-accent">102,450 XRP</span></div>
